base_specs.body:
Use case: ui-mockup. Asset kit_chart, nautical CHART ELEMENT ATLAS, one wide16:9 image2048x1152. Hand-painted opaque digital gouache with expressive pressure-varied black ink contours, heavy outer contour and finer interior lines, angular cut edges, visible selective dry brush, crisp large FLAT shadow shapes and strong chiaroscuro. Refined dark maritime narrative UI matching the approved dialogue and boon reference images: ink-navy / sea-gray backplates, brushed forged iron and aged bronze fittings, very thin worn gold inlay, occasional nautical rope, ship rivets and small bell motifs. Saturated cyan-green one-sided soulfire edge light only where undead/energy is shown; living kingdom accents warm ivory-gold. Highly legible limited palette, quiet interiors. NO 3D render, no photorealism, no low-poly triangular faceting, no airbrushed gradients, no glossy mobile-game look, no ornate generic filigree, no existing game/artist/studio names, no watermark.
Muted flat warm gray-ochre parchment background, black pressure-varied nautical ink marks with selective hand-painted color dabs. Orthographic front view, no table or scenery, generous empty gutters, every element fully isolated and readable for future slicing. Not a complete map.
TOP ROW exactly FIVE difficulty node tokens, each a hand-painted color dab within an ink ring, left-to-right GREEN "轻松", YELLOW "普通", ORANGE "困难", RED "危险", PURPLE shield-shaped BOSS node "首领". Purple boss distinct in shape as well as color.
SECOND ROW exactly FIVE shield medallion BOSS UI EMBLEMS, drawn from documented office props, never invented dynastic heraldry. All five share small royal sun imprint + narrow diagonal regency-red band and subtle ivory-gold trim, NOT turquoise energy. Left-to-right:
"罗德里克" = customs seal over a closed trade ledger;
"阿格尼丝" = warehouse key crossed over a wax tablet;
"安塞姆" = simple SUN device above a prayer book;
"休" = naval military command pennant behind a squared steel shield;
"沃尔特" = official seal case and neatly tied rolled papers, NO crown or armor.
These object-based UI identifiers are visual shorthand, do not introduce new lore.
BOTTOM SECTION: separate long SOLID dark desaturated ink line with small filled waypoints labeled "已走航线"; below a separate DASHED cyan-green ink line with open waypoints and small arrowhead labeled "可前往航线"; each line remains isolated on its own strip. One standalone eight-point ink COMPASS ROSE labeled "罗盘". Three separated small SEA WAVE pattern strips labeled once "海浪纹样", ink blue-gray curves and hatching. Flat matte parchment and crisp hand-inked simplicity, no pseudo map labels, no invented place names, no character portraits, no gold glare. Do not add any count text, only specified labels.
